  <para style="h">Esra</para>
  <para style="toc1">Esra</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esra</para>
  <para style="toc3">Esra</para>
  <para style="mt1">Esra</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1" />
  <para style="s1">Sairọs Anwam Mbon Ntañnsio Enyọñọ Abio Ammọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1" />Nọ asaña akekem ye ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañña ke inua Yerimaiya, ke akpa isua ukara Sairọs adidem Pesia akedaaha ukaara, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịn ke esịd Sairọs adidem Pesia anam anye anọ ewʌhọ ke afịd itie a-anye akekarake anyʌñ awewet ewʌhọ ado asịn ke ñwed:<verse eid="EZR 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2" />“Se Sairọs adidem Pesia atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 1:2">“ ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi anyọñ, annọ miin afịd mme idịd ke iso isọñ anyʌñ ammek miin adibọp tembịd ke Yeruselem ke Yuda nnọọ anye. <verse eid="EZR 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3" />Awo amọ akeedodo ke atu ndufo akeme adika Yeruselem ke Yuda ñkebọp tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, Abasi anye a-abaaha ke Yeruselem, ndin yak Abasi ammọ aba ye ammọ. <verse eid="EZR 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4" />Ndin ke itie akeedodo ake mme ñyọhọnsʌhọ ekedʌñọke, mme amanaisọñ ana enọ ammọ silfa mme kold, ñkpọ inie ye ufene, ye mme enọ imaesịd nọ edat eka tembịd Abasi ke Yeruselem.’ ”<verse eid="EZR 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5" />Do ndin mme adaaha ke mme ufọk Yuda ye Benyamin, mme aku ye mme Lifai, afịd mme awo se Abasi aketuuk esịd, emaebeeñe idem edika ñnyʌñ ñkebọp ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="EZR 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6" />Mme afịd mbọhọidʌñ ammọ emaenwam ammọ ke mme ñkpọ ke silfa ye kold, mme ñkpọ inie ye mme ufene, ye mme enọ ñkpọuto, adian ye mme enọ ima esịd.<verse eid="EZR 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7" />Akanna ado, Adidem Sairọs amaasịññe mme ñkpọ a-akenieghe tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adi, ake Nebukadnesa amaakebiom ato Yeruselem akebon ke tembịd abasi amọ. <verse eid="EZR 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:8" />Adidem Sairọs ake Pesia amaanam Mitredad, akamaakʌk nọ abat mme ñkpọ ado ayaak anọ Sesbasaa, akpanabọọñ Yuda.<verse eid="EZR 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9" />Mme ibad anyịñ ñkpọ ekesịnne ke ñwed edoñño ami:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 1:9" />
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:9">Mme usan ake kold edịb mme duob.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:9">Mme usan ake silfa tọsịn keed (1,000).</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:9">Mme ako ake silfa edịb mme usʌkkeed.<verse eid="EZR 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10" />Mme ntəño usan ake kold edịb mme duob.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:10">Mme ndukemme ntəño usan ake silfa se isaña keed ikie inaañ mme duob (410).</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:10">Mme ñkpoduoho mfen tọsịn keed (1,000).<verse eid="EZR 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11" />Ke afịd, mme ñkpọ ake kold ye silfa akedʌk tọsịn ition mme ikie inaañ (5,400).</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 1:11" />
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 1:11">Sesbasaa amaakoono afịd mme ñkpọ ami ye mme ntañnsio ke abio ato Babilọn anyọñ akaa Yeruselem.<verse eid="EZR 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2" />
  <para style="s1">Anyịñ Mme Ntañnsio E-ekenyọñọke Edi</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1" />Ndin mbon emi edoñño mme awo ke ikpeghe abio e-eketooho ñkọbntem edi, a-Nebukadnesa, adidem Babilọn akekoonoke aka ñkọbntem ke Babilọn (ammọ emaenyọñọ ekaa Yeruselem ye Yuda, anie abio ammọ anyọñ akaa, <verse eid="EZR 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2" />esaña ye Serubabel, Yọsua, Nehimaiya, Seraiya, Reelaiya, Mọdekai, Bilsan, Mispa, Bikfai, Rehum ye Baana):</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:2" />
  <para style="li4" vid="EZR 2:2">Udịm mme anyịñ ideen ke nditọ Isrel:<verse eid="EZR 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3" />Ubon Paros tọsịn iba mme ikie keed mme ata mme duob mme iba (2,172)<verse eid="EZR 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4" />Ubon Sefatia ekedoñño ikie ita mme ata mme duob mme iba (372)<verse eid="EZR 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5" />Ubon Ara ekedo ikie itiaba mme ata mme duob mme ition (775)<verse eid="EZR 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6" />Ubon Pahad-Moab ato udịm Yesua ye Yoab tọsịn iba mme ikie itiaita mme duob mme iba (2,812)<verse eid="EZR 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7" />Ubon Elam tọsịn keed mme ikie iba mme aba mme duob mme inaañ (1,254)<verse eid="EZR 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8" />Ubon Satu ikie usʌkkeed mme aba mme ition (945)<verse eid="EZR 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9" />Nditọ Sakai ikie itiaba mme ata (760)<verse eid="EZR 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10" />Nditọ Bani ikie itiokeed mme aba mme iba (642)<verse eid="EZR 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11" />Ubon Bebai ikie itiokeed mme edịb mme ita (623)<verse eid="EZR 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12" />Ubon Askad tọsịn keed mme ikie iba mme edịb mme iba (1,222)<verse eid="EZR 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13" />Ubon Adọnikam ikie itiokeed mme ata mme itiokeed (666)<verse eid="EZR 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14" />Ubon Bikfai tọsịn iba mme aba mme duob mme itiokeed (2,056)<verse eid="EZR 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15" />Ubon Adịn ikie inaañ mme aba mme duob mme inaañ (454)<verse eid="EZR 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16" />Ubon Ataa (tutu asịm Hesikaiya) ekedo anaañ mme duob mme itiaita (98)<verse eid="EZR 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17" />Ubon Besai akedo ikie ita mme edịb mme ita (323)<verse eid="EZR 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18" />Ubon Yora ikie keed mme duob mme iba (112)<verse eid="EZR 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19" />Ubon Hasum ikie iba mme edịb mme ita (223)<verse eid="EZR 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20" />Ubon Kiba anaañ mme duob mme ition.<verse eid="EZR 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21" />Mbon</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:21">Betlehem ikie keed mme edịb mme ita (123)<verse eid="EZR 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22" />Ubon Netofa aba mme duob mme itiokeed (56)<verse eid="EZR 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23" />Ubon Anatod ikie mme edịb mme itiaita (128)<verse eid="EZR 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24" />Ubon Asmafed ekedo aba mme iba (42)<verse eid="EZR 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25" />Ubon Kiriad Yerịm, Kefira ye Beerod ekedo ikie itiaba mme aba mme ita (743)<verse eid="EZR 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26" />Ubon Rama ye Keba ikie itiokeed mme edịb mme keed (621)<verse eid="EZR 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27" />Ubon Mikmas ikie keed mme edịb mme iba (122)<verse eid="EZR 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28" />Ubon Beteel ye Ai ikie iba mme edịb mme ita (223)<verse eid="EZR 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29" />Ubon Nebo aba mme duob mme iba (52)<verse eid="EZR 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30" />Ubon ake Makbis ikie keed mme aba mme duob mme itiokeed (156)<verse eid="EZR 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31" />Ubon Elam anye ako tọsịn keed mme ikie iba mme aba mme duob mme inaañ (1,254)<verse eid="EZR 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32" />Ubon Harim ikie ita mme edịb (320)<verse eid="EZR 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33" />Ubon Lod, Hadid ye Ọnọ ikie itiaba mme edịb mme ition (725)<verse eid="EZR 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34" />Ubon Yeriko ikie ita mme aba mme ition (345)<verse eid="EZR 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35" />Ubon Senaa tọsịn ita mme ikie itiokeed mme edịb mme duob (3,630).<verse eid="EZR 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36" />Mme aku:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:36">e-edooho ubon</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:36">Yedaiya (e-etooho ufọk Yesua) ikie usʌkkeed mme ata mme duob mme ita (973)<verse eid="EZR 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37" />Ubon Imma tọsịn keed mme aba mme duob mme iba (1,052)<verse eid="EZR 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38" />Ubon Pasọ tọsịn keed mme ikie iba mme aba mme itiaba (1,247)<verse eid="EZR 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39" />Ubon Harim tọsịn keed mme duob mme itiaba (1,017).<verse eid="EZR 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40" />Mme Lifai:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:40">ubon</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:40">Yesua mme Kadmiel (e-etooho ubon Hodafia) ata mme duob mme inaañ (74).<verse eid="EZR 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41" />Mme akwọikwọ:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:41">Ubon</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:41">Asaf ikie keed mme edịb mme itiaita (128).<verse eid="EZR 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42" />Mme akpeme inuaatob tembịd:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:42">mme Ubon</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:42">Salum, Ataa, Talmọn,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:42">Akub, Hatita ye Sobai ikie keed mme edịb mme duob mme usʌkkeed (139).<verse eid="EZR 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43" />Mme anamutom ke tembịd:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:43">Ubon</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:43">Siha, Hasufa, Tabod,<verse eid="EZR 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44" />Keros, Siaha, Padon,<verse eid="EZR 2:44" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45" />Lebana, Hakaba, Akub,<verse eid="EZR 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46" />Hakab, Salmai, Hanan,<verse eid="EZR 2:46" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47" />Kidel, Kaha, Reiya,<verse eid="EZR 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48" />Resịn, Nekoda, Kasam,<verse eid="EZR 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49" />Usa, Pasei, Besai,<verse eid="EZR 2:49" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50" />Asna, Meunịm, Nefusịm,<verse eid="EZR 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51" />Bakbuk, Hakufa, Hahọọ,<verse eid="EZR 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52" />Baslud, Mehida, Haasa,<verse eid="EZR 2:52" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53" />Bakos, Sisera, Tema,<verse eid="EZR 2:53" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54" />Nesia ye Hatifa.<verse eid="EZR 2:54" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55" />Mme ntịppe ubon nditọufọk Sọlọmọn:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:55">mme Ubon</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:55">Sotai, Hasofered, Peruda,<verse eid="EZR 2:55" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56" />Yaala, Daakọn, Kidel,<verse eid="EZR 2:56" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57" />Sefatia, Hatil,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:57">Pokered-Hasebaim ye Ami.<verse eid="EZR 2:57" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58" />Mme anamutom ke tembịd ye Ubon ake nditọufọk Sọlọmọn ikie ita mme anaañ mme duob mme iba (392).<verse eid="EZR 2:58" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59" />Mbon ami eketo mme abio ke Tel Mela, Tel Haasa, Kerub, Adon ye Imaa, ado ammọ ikikanna iwọt ibo ke mme ubon mmimọ eketo ntịppe Isrel:<verse eid="EZR 2:59" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:60" />Mme Ubon</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:60">Delaiya, Tobia ye Nekoda ikie itiokeed mme aba mme duob mme iba (652).<verse eid="EZR 2:60" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61" />Ndin mbon se ikito ke atu mme aku:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:61">mme Ubon</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:61">Hobaiya, Hakos, Basilai (awodeen a-akedọọhọ ayịn awonwaan Basilai awo Kilied ndin ekekoot anye ke anyịñ ado).<verse eid="EZR 2:61" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62" />Mbon ami emaeyem ñwed emana ubon ammọ, ado ammọ ikikanna ikịt ndin ado akenam esio ammọ ke itie ñkpọ mme aku, nte ammọ isanake. <verse eid="EZR 2:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63" />Ke ntoro, adaukara amaanọ uyio ate yak ammọ ekuudia ñkpọ ndomokeed ke atu mme ataa ndisana ndidia tutu aku aba a-akamake Urim ye Tumịm anam utom.<verse eid="EZR 2:63" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64" />Afịd atu awo ado ekedo tọsịn aba mme iba ikie ita mme ata (42,360), <verse eid="EZR 2:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65" />ke esioho mme ifʌn ideen ye ifʌn ibaan tọsịn itiaba mme ikie ita mme edịb mme duob mme itiaba (7,337) efep; ñko ammọ emaenie mme akwọikwọ ideen mme ibaan ikie iba (200). <verse eid="EZR 2:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66" />Ammọ ekenie enañmbakara ikie itiaba mme edịb mme duob mme itiokeed (736), ñwuaha dọñki edo ikie iba mme aba mme ition (245), <verse eid="EZR 2:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67" />mme kamel ikie inaañ mme edịb mme duob mme ition (435) ye dọñki tọsịn itiokeed mme ikie itiaba mme edịb (6,720).<verse eid="EZR 2:67" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68" />Ke ini ammọ emaekewuọ ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke Yeruselem, usʌk mme mbọọñ ufọk emaenọ enọ imaesịd nọ eben etịmme ebọp ufọk Abasi ke itie isọñ a-anye akedaaha. <verse eid="EZR 2:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69" />Ammọ ekenọ mme ñkpọ utom yak ebon ke ufọk unịm akʌk akeene ukeme ammọ: kold ke darik tọsịn ata mme keed (61,000)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:69 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 500</char></note>, silfa ke mina tọsịn ition (5,000)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:69 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 3 me ñkpọ nte metrịk tọọn 2.8</char></note> ye mme afọñ nsiine mme aku ikie (100).<verse eid="EZR 2:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70" />Mme aku, mme Lifai, mme akwọikwọ, mme akpeme inuaatob, mme anamutom ke tembịd emaenyọñọ ekedʌñọ ke mme abio ammọ, esaña ye ubaak mme awo mbon mfen, ndin nditọ Isrel mfen se ikisʌhọ emaenyʌñ ekedʌñ ke mme abio ammọ.<verse eid="EZR 2:70" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3" />
  <para style="s1">Adimaana Mbọp Akpokoro Uwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1" />Ke ini ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba amaakedisịm nọ nditọ Isrel eketekke eba ke mme abio ammọ, mme awo emaedisoobo idem itie keed ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="EZR 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2" />Akema Yọsua ayịn Yosadak ye mme aku mfen ye Serubabel ayịn Sieltiel ye mme nsaña amọ emaetọọñọ edibọp akpokoro uwa Abasi Isrel nọ enam ufọfọb uwa ke itie ado, nọ asaña akekem se ewet ke Mbed Moses, awo Abasi. <verse eid="EZR 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3" />Akpesʌkado ndịk mbon se ikiba ikanna ammọ akenamma ammọ, ammọ emaebọp akpokoro uwa ke anyọñ itie itiad idakisọñ amọ, enyʌñ enam ufọfọb uwa do enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa mme uwa ake ubakusen ye ake ndubiayio. <verse eid="EZR 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4" />Ndin nọ asaña akekem naña ekewet, ammọ emaenam Usọrọ mme Tabanakịd ye akemibad ñkpọ ufọfọb uwa se ekebiere enịm enọ usen keedekeed. <verse eid="EZR 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5" />Ado amaakeboiyo, ammọ emaewa ufọfọb uwa ke ini ke ini, mme uwa ake Ufa Afiọñ, ye mme uwa ekenịmme enọ mme ndisana usọrọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ye mme mbon se ekeben edi nte mme uwa enọ imaesịd enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EZR 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6" />Ke akpa usen ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba, ammọ emaetọọñọ adinam ufọfọb uwa nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, akpesʌkado awo ikisịnne itiad idakisọñ tembịd diin.<verse eid="EZR 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adimaana Mbọp Tembịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7" />Ndin emaenọ mme abọbufọk ye mme adomusọ akʌk; enọ mbon Sidọn ye Tai ndidia ye ukọd ye adan ọlif, nọ ammọ ekoono mme ekpad sida esaña ke inyañ eto Lebanọn ekewuọ Yopa, kpa naña Sairọs adidem Pesia akenọọ ammọ uyio.<verse eid="EZR 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8" />Ke ayọhọ afiọñ iba ke ayọhọ isua iba ke ammọ emaekediwuọ ufọk Abasi ke Yeruselem, Serubabel ayịn Sieltiel, Yọsua ayịn Yosadak ye mme mbon awo mfen (mme aku, mme Lifai, ye afịd mbon ñko e-eketooho ñkọbntem edisịm Yeruselem) emaetọọñọ utom. Ammọ ekemek mme Lifai ekesọññọ isua edịb me akanna ado yak ese ñkpọ ebaña ubọbufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EZR 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9" />Yọsua ye mme nditọ ideen amọ ye mme nditọeka ideen amọ ye Kadmiel ye nditọ ideen amọ (nditọ ake Hodafia) ye nditọ ideen Henadad ye nditọ ammọ ideen ye nditọeka ammọ ideen, afịd mme Lifai emaediana keed ke adise anyen ke mbon se ikinam utom ke ufọk Abasi.<verse eid="EZR 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10" />Ke ini mme abọbufọk emaekesịn itiad idakisọñ tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, mme aku ke mme nsiine ammọ ye mme adukpoñ ammọ, ye mme Lifai (nditọ ideen Asaf) ye mme ñkukwak, emaedat itie ammọ ke aditooro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ekeene usʌñ mbed naña adidem Isrel, Defid, akenọọ uyio. <verse eid="EZR 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11" />Ammọ emaekwọ itooro ye ekọọm ami enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZR 3:11">“Anye a-afọn ido;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 3:11">ima a-anye anieghe anọ Isrel, asʌk adada ke nsi-nsi.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZR 3:11">Ndin afịd mme awo emaekwọ ke akpọsọñ uyio enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EZR 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12" />Ado uwak mme aku, Lifai ye mme adaaha ke mme ubon, emaekpoon awo ke isua emana, e-emaekekekịt akaan tembịd, emaesio ñkpo etua ke ini ammọ ekekịtte naña esịn itiad idakisọñ tembịd, ke ini uwak mbon mfen ekesioho ñkpo idaara. <verse eid="EZR 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13" />Awo ndomokeed ikikanna idiọọñọ me akedo uyio ayịd me akedo ñkpọ idaara, sia mme awo emaenam uyom eti-eti. Ndin emaekop uyom ado ke ataa anyan usʌñ.<verse eid="EZR 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ñkpahaukod ke abaña Aditịmme Mbọp Tembịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1" />Ke ini mme asua ikọd Yuda ye Benyamin ekekoppo ebo ke mbon se ekebiiñe esịññe ke abio ekesʌk ebọp tembịd enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, <verse eid="EZR 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2" />ammọ emaekaa ekesoobo Serubabel ye mme adaaha ke mme ubon enyʌñ ebo, “Yak ñnyịn inwam ndufo adibọp tembịd, sia ñnyịn ñko, nte ndufo, iyem iso Abasi ndufo, ñko ñnyịn ikisʌk isinanam uwa inọ anye tọọñọ ke ini Esahadọn adidem Asiria, a-akibenne ñnyịn adi mi.”<verse eid="EZR 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3" />Ado Serubabel, Yọsua ye mme adaaha mfen ke mme ubon ke Isrel emaebọọrọ ebo, “Ndufo inieghe udeeme ye ñnyịn ke adibọp tembịd nnọọ Abasi ñnyịn. Ñnyịn ke idem ñnyịn ikpọọñ idiibọp inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, nte Adidem Sairọs, adidem Pesia, akinọọhọ ñnyịn uyio.”<verse eid="EZR 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4" />Ndin mbon mbọhọidʌñ ado emaenwana adisịn mmemidem nnọọ mbon Yuda nọ ato do ammọ esịññe idem ekpọñ ndin ekop ndịk ebaña adika iso mbọp ufọk ado. <verse eid="EZR 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5" />Ammọ (mbon esen idịd ado) emaenọ mme ñkpoon mbon utom ubọkedem nọ ato do ammọ esịn ndutịme enyʌñ enam uduak ubọp ufọk akpu, ke afịd ini ukara Sairọs adidem Pesia tutu awuọ ini ukara Dariọs adidem Pesia.<verse eid="EZR 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfaaña Mfen ke Idak Ukara Seeses ye Ataseeses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6" />Ke ntọọñọ ukara adidem Seeses, ammọ emaewet ñwed edot mbon Yuda ye Yeruselem uyio.<verse eid="EZR 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7" />Ke ini ukara Ataseeses adidem Pesia, Bislam, Mitredad, Tabeel ye mme nsaña amọ mbon ako, emaewet ñwedetob enọ esọk Ataseeses. Ammọ ekekama abiisi ikọ Aram ewet ñwedetob ado ke usem Aram.<verse eid="EZR 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8" />Rehum, adaiso ekọñ ye Simsai, awedñwed emaewet idiọọk ñwedetob ebaña Yeruselem enọ esọk adidem Ataseses ebo ete:<verse eid="EZR 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9" />Rehum, adaiso ekọñ ye Simsai, awedñwed, ñkọrọ afịd mme nsaña ammọ mbon ñko, mme abiideikpe, ñkpoon mme adaaha ye mme akamautom ke iwuod mbon Pesia, Uruk ye Babilọn, mbon Elam ake Susa, <verse eid="EZR 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10" />ñko ye mme idịd mbon mfen, ake ekamba abọọñ Asubanipal akesịññeke akebono ke abio Sameria ye ke itie mfen ke Edem Inyañ Yufretis.<verse eid="EZR 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11" />(Ukem-ukem ñwedetob ammọ ekenọọhọ anye ado ami).</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:11">Enọ esọk Adidem Ataseses,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:11">Ami ato ikọd mfo, mbon Edem Inyañ Yufretis:<verse eid="EZR 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12" />Adidem akpena adiọọñọ abọ ke mme Yuu e-ekutooho fiin edi ibịne ñnyịn ekpọñ ekaa Yeruselem, ndin ke ammọ esʌk etịmme ebọp idiọọk abio ntịme ado. Ammọ esʌk emaana ediọñ mme ndibene ado edoñño ufa enyʌñ ediọñ mme itiad idakisọñ ado.<verse eid="EZR 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13" />Ke ado amaaboiyo, adidem akpena adiọọñọ abo ke adieke ebọppọ abio ado, enyʌñ emaana enam mme ndibene ado edo ufa, awo idiikpeeghe taks, me utịb me etịbe aba, ndin ami ayaafịna mme usʌñ unie akʌk adidem. <verse eid="EZR 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14" />Sia ñnyịn iba ke mbed akwere adidem, ikpifọnnọ ñnyịn adikịt naña adidem adia abuud, ado anam yak ñnyịn inọ etob ami nọ edọkkọ adidem, <verse eid="EZR 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15" />nọ enam nduuñọ ke mme akaan ñwed esed mbon se imaikibabak iba ke ukara. Ke esịd mme ñwed ado, afo ayaakịt abo ke abio ami ado abio nsọñiwuod, esịn ntịme ye mme ndidem ye mme abio ukara, itie a-anieghe anyan etob nsọñiwuod ye ndidem tọọñọ ke esed. Ntak e-ekesoboke abio ami ado ado. <verse eid="EZR 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16" />Ñnyịn idọkkọ adidem ibo ate, ke adieke ebọppọ abio ami, enyʌñ enam mme ndibene amọ edoñño ufa, afo uduunieghe udeeme ñkpọ aba ke Edem Inyañ Yufretis.<verse eid="EZR 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17" />Ndin adidem amaanọ ibọọrọ ami:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:17">Enọ esọk Rehum adaiwuod ekọñ, Simsai awedñwed ye mme nsaña ammọ mbon ako, e-edʌññọ ke Sameria</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:17">ye ke itie mfen ke Edem Inyañ Yufretis:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 4:17">Mmikọọm ndufo!<verse eid="EZR 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18" />Emaekoot enyʌñ ekappa ñwedetob a-ndufo ekenọọhọ isọk ñnyịn ke iso mmi. <verse eid="EZR 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19" />Ami mmaanọ uyio ndin emaenam nduuñọ, ñko emaekịt ke abio ami anie anyan etob adinwana ye mme ndidem, anyʌñ ado itie idʌñ anwan ye nsọñiwuod. <verse eid="EZR 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20" />Yeruselem emaesinie mme ñkpọsọñ ndidem ekekaarake ke afịd Edem Inyañ Yufretis, ndin emaesikpe taks, utịb ye etịbe enọ ammọ. <verse eid="EZR 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21" />Ke ntoro, inọ uyio bo yak ibon ado etre utom, mbaak awo adimaana akebọp abio ado tutu ami nnọ ewʌhọ mbo enam ntoro. <verse eid="EZR 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22" />Ndufo inekke ikpeme mbaak idifre ibaña ñkpọ ami. Nsoo inam nọ ndufo eyak utọ ibak uduak ami aka iso, nọ aben mbiara anọ ñkpọ ubọọñ adidem?<verse eid="EZR 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23" />Ekesʌk ekokoot ukem ikpañwed ñwedetob Adidem Ataseses enọ Rehum ye Simsai awedñwed ye mme nsaña ammọ, ammọ emaekaa ini keed ebịne mme Yuu ado ke Yeruselem enyʌñ ekpak ammọ ke ñkanubọk ete etre utom.<verse eid="EZR 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24" />Ke ntom utom adimaana mbọp ufọk Abasi ke Yeruselem amaatuak ada, tutu ayọhọ isua iba ke ini ukara Dariọs Adidem Pesia.<verse eid="EZR 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5" />
  <para style="s1">Tatenai Awet Ñwedetob Anọ Dariọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1" />Akema prọfed Hakai ye prọfed Sakaraiya, awo ubon Iddo, emaetañ prọfesi enọ mme Yuu ke Yuda ye ke Yeruselem ke anyịñ Abasi Isrel, a-akekarake ammọ. <verse eid="EZR 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2" />Ndin Serubabel ayịn Seltiel ye Yọsua ayịn Yosadak emaetọọñọ utom adimaana mbọp ufọk Abasi ke Yeruselem. Ndin mme prọfed Abasi emaeba ye ammọ, adinọ ammọ unwam.<verse eid="EZR 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3" />Ke ini ado Tatenai, adaukara ke Edem Inyañ Yufretis, ye Seta-Bosenai ye mme nsaña ammọ emaekaa ebịne ammọ ekebịp ete, “Anie akinọọ ndufo adudu adimaana mbọp tembịd ami, adinyʌñ ñkweeñe anye?” <verse eid="EZR 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4" />Ammọ ñko emaebịp ebo, “Mme anie awo edo mbon se inam utom ubọp ufọk ado?” <verse eid="EZR 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5" />Ado anyen Abasi ammọ akesʌk akpeme mme ñkpisọñ mme Yuu, ke ntoro awo ikinyʌññọ ikpan ammọ adinam utom tutu eben etob esọk Dariọs, tutu enyʌñ ebọ ibọọrọ anye awette eto anye.<verse eid="EZR 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6" />Anyem ado ñwedetob Tatenai, adaukara ke Edem Inyañ Yufretis, ye Seta-Bosenai ye mme nsaña ammọ, mme ikpọ akama utom Edem Inyañ Yufretis ekenọọhọ esọk Dariọs. <verse eid="EZR 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:7" />Ñwed se ammọ ekenọọ akebo ntom:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 5:7">Adidem Dariọs:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 5:7">Ekọọm emem.<verse eid="EZR 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8" />Yak adidem adiọọñọ abo ke ñnyịn imaikaa efaak abio ukara Yuda, ikiwuọ tembịd akwa Abasi. Mme awo ado esʌk ebọp ufọk ado ye mme ikpọ itiad enyʌñ edọñ mme eto ke mme ndibene. Ammọ etịñ anyen enam utom ado, utom ado anyʌñ anekke akaa iso usọp-usọp ke ubọk ammọ.<verse eid="EZR 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9" />Ñnyịn imaibịp mme ñkpisọñ ammọ inyʌñ ibo ammọ ite, “Anie awo ikinọọ ndufo adudu adimaana mbọp tembịd ami ñnyʌñ nnam anye mmaa?” <verse eid="EZR 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10" />Ñnyịn imainyʌñ ibịp ammọ mme anyịñ ammọ, nọ ñnyịn ikpiwet anyịñ mme adaaha ammọ unọ fiin nọ afo adiọọñọ.<verse eid="EZR 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11" />Ibọọrọ se ammọ ekinọọ ñnyịn ado ami:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 5:11" />
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 5:11">“Ñnyịn ido nditọufọk Abasi anyọñ ye isọñ, ndin ñnyịn itịmme ibọp tembịd ake emaekebọbọp ke mme uwak isua ke edem, anye ake ekamba adidem ke Isrel amaakebọbọp ama. <verse eid="EZR 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12" />Ado sia mme eteete ñnyịn emaeyat Abasi anyọñ esịd, anye amaayaak ammọ asịn ke ubọk Nebukadnesa, awo Kald, adidem Babilọn, a-akebiatta tembịd ami anyʌñ asịññe mbon ado anọ yak eka Babilọn.<verse eid="EZR 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13" />“Ado ke akpa isua ukara Sairọs adidem Babilọn, Adidem Sairọs amaanọ ewʌhọ yak emaana ebọp ufọk Abasi ami. <verse eid="EZR 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14" />Anye ke idem amọ amaasịññe ato tembịd ke Babilọn mme ñkpọ ake kold ye silfa ke ufọk Abasi, a-Nebukadnesa akekoonoke ke tembịd ke Yeruselem aben adi tembịd ke Babilọn. Ndin Adidem Sairọs amaayak ammọ anọ awodeen e-ekoodo Sesbasa, a-anye akemekke nte adaukara, <verse eid="EZR 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15" />ndin adidem Sairọs amaabo anye ate, ‘Koono mme ñkpọ ami nyʌñ kedọñ ammọ ke tembịd ke Yeruselem. Ñko nyʌñ maana bọp ufọk Abasi ke akaan itie amọ.’<verse eid="EZR 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16" />“Ke ntoro ke Sesbasa ami akedi adisịn itiad idakisọñ ufọk Abasi ke Yeruselem. Tọọñọ ke usen ado tutu mfịn, esʌk eba ke adibọbọp anye, ado utom ikweeñeke diin.”<verse eid="EZR 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17" />Do ndin, adieke adidem amaaha, yak anam nduuñọ ke mme ñwed ekpurikpu ubọọñ esed ake Babilọn nọ ese me Adidem Sairọs, ke akpanikọ, amaanịm ewʌhọ abo yak emaana ebọp ufọk Abasi ami ke Yeruselem. Amaanam yak adidem anọ se anye abiide abaña ñkpọ ami isọk ñnyịn.<verse eid="EZR 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ewʌhọ Dariọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1" />Adidem Dariọs, ndin, amaanọ uyio, ndin emaeyeem ke ekpurikpu ubon ñkpọ esed ekedọññọ ke ufọk ubon ñkpọ ke Babilọn. <verse eid="EZR 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2" />Emaekịt ikpañwed ke akpọsọñ itie ubọọñ ake Ekbatana ke ikpeghe ukara Midia, ndin se ekewet do ado ami:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 6:2">Ñwed Aditoiyo:<verse eid="EZR 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3" />Ke akpa isua ukara Adidem Sairọs, adidem amaanọ ewʌhọ ke abaña tembịd Abasi ke Yeruselem:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 6:3" />
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 6:3">Yak emaana ebọp tembịd ado nte itie ediinam mme uwa, ndin yak esịn mme itiad idakisọñ amọ. Anye anie adido kubid ata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte mita 27</char></note> ke unyọọñ ye kubid ata ke ukpa, <verse eid="EZR 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4" />anie udịm ñkpoon itiad ita ye ake eto keed. Enie edidat akʌk ke iseakʌk ubọọñ adidem ñkpe utom ami. <verse eid="EZR 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5" />Ñko, ana ekoono mme ñkpọ ake kold ye silfa, a-Nebukadnesa akekoonoke ke tembịd ke Yeruselem aka ke Babilọn, etịmme ekebon ke mme itie ammọ ke tembịd ke Yeruselem; ana ekoono ammọ ekedọñ ke ufọk Abasi.<verse eid="EZR 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6" />Ndin, Tatenai, adaukara ke Edem Inyañ Yufretis, ye Seta-Bosenai ye ndufo mbon mfen, mme ikpọ akama utom ke idak ukara ado, ikiikaa itie ado. <verse eid="EZR 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7" />Ndufo ikiisịn ñkpahaukod ke utom adibọp tembịd Abasi. Yak mme adaukara ake mme Yuu ye mme ñkpisọñ mme Yuu emaana ebọp ufọk Abasi ado ke akaan itie amọ.<verse eid="EZR 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8" />Akanna ado, ami mmenyʌñ nnọ ewʌhọ se ndufo enie edinam nnọọ mme ñkpisọñ mme Yuu ami ke adibọp ufọk Abasi ami:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 6:8">Ana ekpe afịd-afịd se ammọ ebiat ke utom ado eto itie ubon ñkpọ adidem, eto mme inie ake Edem Inyañ Yufretis, mbaak utom ado aditre. <verse eid="EZR 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9" />Ana enọ ammọ se eyeyem kwa usen, ikiibiat ini aba: mme ñyaaraenañ, akukịmedọñ, mme ñyịn akukịmedọñ, yak enam ufọfọb uwa enọ Abasi anyọñ, ye wiid, inʌñ, ukọd ye adan ọlif, naña mme aku ke Yeruselem ekeyem, <verse eid="EZR 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10" />nọ ammọ enam mme uwa anemme Abasi anyọñ esịd enyʌñ ebọñ akam ke ufọn adidem ye nditọ ideen adidem.<verse eid="EZR 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11" />Ke adidian do, Ami mmewuuk mbo adieke awo ndomokeed abiada ewʌhọ ami, yak edʌt abom esio ke ufọk ammọ enyʌñ ekịm ammọ ewot ammọ. Ndin ke ntak idiọọkñkpọ ami, ufọk ammọ ayaakappa ado itie uduọñọ mbio. <verse eid="EZR 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12" />Yak Abasi, a-akenamma Anyịñ amọ adʌñ do, adooro adidem me awo akeedodo afep a-akpedịppeke ubọk adikpəho ewʌhọ ami me adiwuut tembịd ami ke Yeruselem.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 6:12">Ami Dariọs mmewuuk ami. Yak esuuk anyen enam ewʌhọ ami.<verse eid="EZR 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adibọp Tembịd Ñkweeñe Ñnyʌñ Ndiọñ Anye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13" />Akekem, ke ntak ewʌhọ Adidem Dariọs akenọọhọ, Tatenai, adaukara Edem Inyañ Yufretis, ye Seta-Bosenai ye mme nsaña ammọ emaenam utom ado ke ntịñanyen. <verse eid="EZR 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14" />Ke ntoro, mme ñkpisọñ mme Yuu emaekaa iso ebọp ufọk enyʌñ ekịt mfọn ke idak ukwọrọikọ prọfed Hakai ye Sakaraiya, ayịn Iddo. Ammọ emaebọp tembịd ema akeene ewʌhọ Abasi Isrel ye mme mbed Sairọs, Dariọs ye Ataseses, mme ndidem Pesia. <verse eid="EZR 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15" />Emaekweeñe edibọp tembịd ke ayọhọ usen ita ke afiọñ Ada, ke ayọhọ isua itiokeed ke ukara Adidem Dariọs.<verse eid="EZR 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16" />Ndin nditọ Isrel: mme aku, mme Lifai ye mbon mfen eketañña esịññe ke abio, emaenam usọrọ adibeere ufọk Abasi ke idaara. <verse eid="EZR 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17" />Ke usọrọ adibeere ufọk Abasi ami, ammọ emaenọ ñyaaraenañ ikie, akukịmedọñ ikie iba, ñyịn akukịmedọñ ikie inaañ, nte uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ nnọọ afịd Isrel, ye akpo ebod duob mme iba, keedekeed ke iwuod mme esiin Isrel. <verse eid="EZR 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18" />Ndin ammọ emaenịm mme aku ke mme ikpeghe ammọ ye mme Lifai ke mme atu ammọ, ke adinam utom Abasi ke Yeruselem, akeene se ewet ke Ñwed Moses.<verse eid="EZR 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19" />Ke ayọhọ usen duob mme inaañ ke akpa afiọñ, mbon se ekebịne esio ke abio emaenam Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo. <verse eid="EZR 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20" />Mme aku ye mme Lifai emaenam idem ammọ asana, afịd ammọ emaenyʌñ esana ke adinam usọrọ. Mme Lifai emaewot ñkpʌk edọñ Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo enọ afịd mbon se eketañ esio ke abio, ye mme ayakka ammọ, mme aku, ye idem ammọ ñko. <verse eid="EZR 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21" />Ndin nditọ Isrel e-eketañña esio ke abio ekenyọñọ edi, emaeta anye, ukem ye mbon se imiikiwaanake ke mme mbubiam ido mme Gentile e-ekedooho mbọhọidʌñ ammọ ke ntak adiyem iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel. <verse eid="EZR 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22" />Ammọ emaenam Usọrọ Uyo Yiis imiisịneke ke usen itiaba ke idaara, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayọhọ ammọ ye idaara ke adikpəho ido adidem Asiria nọ anwam ke utom ubọp ufọk Abasi, Abasi Isrel.<verse eid="EZR 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7" />
  <para style="s1">Esra Adi Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1" />Ke mme afịd ñkpọ ami emaekeboiyo, ke ini ukara Ataseeses, adidem Pesia, Esra ayịn Seraiya, ayịn Asaria, ayịn Hilkia, <verse eid="EZR 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2" />ayịn Salum, ayịn Sadọk, ayịn Ahitub, <verse eid="EZR 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3" />ayịn Amaria, ayịn Asaria, ayịn Meraiyọd, <verse eid="EZR 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4" />ayịn Serahaiya, ayịn Usi, ayịn Buki, <verse eid="EZR 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5" />ayịn Abisua, ayịn Finehas, ayịn Eliasa, ayịn Erọn, ekamba aku, <verse eid="EZR 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6" />Esra ami aketo Babilọn awuọ adi. Anye akedo andikpeeb akenekkeke adiọọñọ Mbed Moses, ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, akenọọhọ. Ndin adidem amaanọ anye afịd ñkpọ se anye akebeeñe, sia ubọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ amaaba ye anye. <verse eid="EZR 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7" />Ubaak nditọ Isrel, ye mme aku, mme Lifai, mbon ikwọ, mme akpeme inuaatob ye mme anamutom ke tembịd ñko, emaenyʌñ ewuọñọ edi ke Yeruselem ke ayọhọ isua itiaba ke ayio ukara Adidem Ataseeses.<verse eid="EZR 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8" />Esra akediwuọ Yeruselem ke ayọhọ afiọñ ition ke ayọhọ isua ukara itiaba Adidem ado. <verse eid="EZR 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:9" />Anye aketọọñọ isañ amọ ke Babilọn ke akpa usen ke akpa afiọñ, ndin anye akediwuọ Yeruselem ke akpa usen ke ayọhọ afiọñ ition, sia ubọk mfọn Abasi amọ amaadoro anye ke idem. <verse eid="EZR 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10" />Sia Esra amaanekke awuuk esịd amọ abaña uduuñọ ye adinịm Mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ñnyʌñ ñkpeep mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed ke Isrel.<verse eid="EZR 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adidem Ataseeses Anọ Ñwedetob Esọk Esra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11" />Ami ado ukem-ukem ñwedetob A-adidem Ataseeses akenọọhọ aku Esra, andikpeeb Mbed, awo a-akenekkeke adiọọñọ mme ñkpọ e-esañake ye mme mbed ye ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenịmme anọ Isrel:<verse eid="EZR 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12" />Ataseses, adidem mme ndidem,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 7:12">Awet Anọ aku Esra, andikpeeb Mbed ake Abasi anyọñ:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 7:12">Ekọọm.<verse eid="EZR 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13" />Ami mmewuuk idahami mbo nte ke nditọ Isrel akeedodo ke idak ubọọñ mmi, ñko ye mme aku ye mme Lifai, eyemme edukeene fiin ñkaa Yeruselem, ekeme edika. <verse eid="EZR 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14" />Adidem udọñ fiin ye mme anọitem amọ itiaba abo yak ekebiime ebaña Yuda ye Yeruselem ke abaña Mbed Abasi mfo, a-adooho aba ke ubọk mfo. <verse eid="EZR 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15" />Ñko toiyo bo ke imikoono silfa ye kold ake adidem ye mme anọitem amọ enọọhọ Abasi Isrel ke ima, ake itie idʌñ amọ adooho ke Yeruselem, <verse eid="EZR 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16" />dian ye afịd mme silfa ye kold afo akebọọhọ ato ukara ikpeghe Babilọn, ye mme enọ imaesịd ake mme awo ye mme aku enọọhọ ebo enịm ke tembịd Abasi ammọ ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="EZR 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17" />Kịt bo ke imidat akʌk ami idep ñyaaraenañ, akukịmedọñ ye mme ñyịn akukịmedọñ, dian ye mme enọ mfịd, ye enọ ukọd, nyʌñ wa ammọ ke anyọñ akpokoro uwa ke tembịd nọ Abasi mfo ke Yeruselem.<verse eid="EZR 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18" />Ndin afo ye nditọ Isrel emekeme ndin edinam se ndufo ekịt ebo ke anekke afọn ye mme silfa ye kold mbon ñko, akeene uduak Abasi ndufo. <verse eid="EZR 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19" />Ben nọ Abasi ke Yeruselem afịd mme ñkpọ se eyaak unọ fiin ebo aben anam ukpono ke tembịd Abasi mfo. <verse eid="EZR 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20" />Ndin akpedo aba ñkpọ mfen e-eyemme adidat nnam utom tembịd Abasi mfo a-adooho se afo anie adinọ, afo amekeme adisio ke ufọk ubonoñkpọ adidem nnọọ.<verse eid="EZR 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21" />Ndin ami, Adidem Ataseses, mmenam ewʌhọ mbo yak afịd mbon se ikama ñkpọ ufọk adidem esuuk anyen enọ se akpedodo aku Esra, andikpeeb Mbed Abasi anyọñ, abịppe ammọ, <verse eid="EZR 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22" />tutu awuọ ñkpọ nte talen silfa ikie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 3 3/4 me ñkpọ nte metrịk tọọn 3.4</char></note> (100), kọọ wiid ikie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 18 me ñkpọ nte metrịk tọọn 16</char></note>, ikịm ukọd ikie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte lita 2,200</char></note>, atu adan ọlif ikie ye inʌñ naña eyeyem. <verse eid="EZR 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23" />Se adodo Abasi anyọñ anọọhọ uyio abo enam, yak esuuk anyen enam ke ntak tembịd Abasi anyọñ. Ke nsoo ntak ke iyadesịd amọ adiidoro ke ukara adidem ye mme nditọ amọ ke idem? <verse eid="EZR 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24" />Afo ñko ana adiọọñọ abo ke afo unieghe unen adibọi ataksi, utịb me etịbe nto mme aku, mme Lifai, mbon ikwọ, akpeme inuaatob, mme anam utom ke tembịd me mme anam utom mbon mfen ke ufọk Abasi ami.<verse eid="EZR 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25" />Ndin afo, Esra, kama aniọñ Abasi mfo, a-afo anieghe, mek mme akpeikpe ye mme abiideikpe yak ekpe unen enọ afịd mbon Edem Inyañ Yufretis; mek mbon se idiọọñọ mme mbed Abasi ndufo. Afo ñko ana akpeep mbon se imiidiọọñọke mme mbed ado. <verse eid="EZR 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26" />Awo akeedodo ake imiinịmme mbed Abasi mfo ye mbed adidem ana abọ ufen, akeme adido ñkpa, adibịn nsio ke abio, adidia isob, me ñkpakọb.<verse eid="EZR 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27" />Yak etooro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme nsọbom ñnyịn, asịnne ñkpọ ami ke esịd adidem adiben ukpono nnọọ ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke Yeruselem ke utọ usʌñ ami, <verse eid="EZR 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28" />anyʌññọ afọn ido ye ami ke iso adidem ye mme anọitem amọ ye mme afịd ñkpoon ñkpọsọñ mbon utom amọ. Sia ubọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi akeba ye ami, ami mmaakop uko ñnyʌñ ñkoono mme adaaha Isrel nọ esaña ye ami ekesoobo adidem.<verse eid="EZR 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ñwed Anyịñ mme Adaaha ke mme Ubon Ekenyọññọ Edi ye Esra</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1" />Mme anyịñ mme adaaha ke mme ubon ye mbon se ekewet anyịñ esịn ye ammọ e-ekeñkeeneke miin eto Babilọn edi ke ini ukara Adidem Ataseeses edoñño ami:<verse eid="EZR 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2" />Ake ubon Finehas:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:2">Kesọm;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:2">ake ubon Itama:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:2">Dandiel;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:2">ake ubon Defid:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:2">Hatus <verse eid="EZR 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3" />ake nditọ Sekanaiya;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:3">ake ubon Paros;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:3">Sakaraiya, ñko emaewet mme anyịñ ideen ikie mme aba mme duob (150) edian ye anye;<verse eid="EZR 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4" />ake ubon Pahad-Moab:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:4">Eliehoenai ayịn Serahaiya, ñko emaewet mme anyịñ ideen ikie iba (200) edian ye anye;<verse eid="EZR 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5" />ake ubon Satu:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:5">Sekanaiya ayịn Yahasiel, emaewet mme anyịñ ideen ikie ita (300) edian ye anye;<verse eid="EZR 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6" />ake ubon Adịn:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:6">Ebed ayịn Yọnatan, emaewet mme anyịñ ideen aba mme duob edian ye anye;<verse eid="EZR 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7" />ake ubon Elam:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:7">Yesaiya ayịn Atalia, emaewet mme anyịñ ideen ata mme duob edian ye anye;<verse eid="EZR 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8" />ubon ake Sefatia:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:8">Sebadaiya ayịn Maikel, emaewet mme anyịñ ideen anaañ edian ye anye;<verse eid="EZR 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9" />ake ubon Yoab:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:9">Obadaiya ayịn Yehiel, emaewet anyịñ mme ideen ikie iba mme duob mme itiaita (218) edian ye anye;<verse eid="EZR 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10" />ake ubon Bani:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:10">Selomid ayịn Yosifia, emaewet mme anyịñ ideen ikie mme ata (160) edian ye anye;<verse eid="EZR 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11" />ake ubon Bebai,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:11">Sakaraiya ayịn Bebai: emaewet mme anyịñ ideen edịb mme itiaita (28) edian ye anye;<verse eid="EZR 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12" />ake ubon Askad:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:12">Yohanan ayịn Hakatan, emaewet mme anyịñ ideen ikie mme duob (110) edian ye anye;<verse eid="EZR 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13" />ake mme akpatre ubon Adọnikam:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:13">mme anyịñ ammọ ekedoñño Elifeled, Yeiyel ye Semaiya, emaewet mme anyịñ ideen ata (60) edian ye ammọ;<verse eid="EZR 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14" />ake ubon Bikfai:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:14">Utai ye Sakọọ, emaewet mme anyịñ ideen ata mme duob (60) edian ye ammọ.<verse eid="EZR 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Utịmme Ñnyọñ Ñkaa Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15" />Ami mmaakoot ammọ mbok itie keed ke inuaakpa a-afegheke aka Ahafa, ñnyịn imainyʌñ iba do ke usen ita. Ami mmaayeem ke atu mme awo ye mme aku, ado ami ñkekịtte awo Lifai ndomokeed do. <verse eid="EZR 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16" />Ndin mmaadọñ ekoot Eliesa, Ariel, Semaiya, Elnatan, Yarịb, Ednatan, Natan, Sakaraiya ye Mesulam, e-ekedoññoke mme adaaha, Yoiyarịb ye Ednatan, e-ekedoññoke mme nta ifiọk, nọ edi ke iso mmi, <verse eid="EZR 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17" />ndin ami mmaanọ ammọ uyio mbo yak eka ebịne Iddo, adaaha ke Kasifia. Ami mmaadọkkọ ammọ se ediitañ ye Iddo ye mme Lifai mbio ako, ye mme anamutom ke tembịd ke Kasifia, nọ ammọ ekoono mme anam ñkpọ ufọk isọk ñnyịn nọ enam utom ke ufọk Abasi ñnyịn. <verse eid="EZR 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18" />Sia ubọk mfọn Abasi ñnyịn amaaba ye ñnyịn, ammọ emaeben Serebia, awo etiiwuod akanna ñkpọ anam, aketooho ubon Mahli ayịn Lifai, ayịn Isrel, ye nditọ ideen ye nditọeka ideen Serebia, afịd ekedo duob mme itiaita; <verse eid="EZR 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19" />ye Hasabaiya, dian ye Yesaiya, ake ubon Merari ye mme nditọeka amọ ideen ye mme nditọ ayịneka amọ ideen, afịd ekedoñño ideen edịb. <verse eid="EZR 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:20" />Ammọ ñko emaeben mme anamutom ikie iba mme edịb (220) ke tembịd edi, mbon se Defid ye mme adaaha ekesịññe enịm adinwam mme Lifai. Emaewet afịd ammọ anyịñ.<verse eid="EZR 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21" />Ke Inuaakpa Ahafa, ami mmaasian utreudia, nọ ñnyịn isuuhọ idem ñnyịn ke iso Abasi inyʌñ ibeeñe anye mfọn usʌñisañ inọ idem ñnyịn ye mme nditọ ñnyịn, ye afịd inie ñnyịn. <verse eid="EZR 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22" />Abuud amammʌm miin adibịp adidem mbo yak inọ mbon ekọñ ye mme awad enañmbakara nọ ikpeme ñnyịn mbaak mme asua ke usʌñ, sia ñnyịn imaidọkkọ adidem ibo ite, “Ubọk mfọn Abasi ñnyịn aba ye afịd mbon se iyem anye, ado ekamba iyadesịd amọ anwana ye mbon se isịn anye.” <verse eid="EZR 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23" />Ndin ñnyịn imaitre ndidia inyʌñ ikpeiye Abasi ñnyịn ibaña ñkpọ ami, ndin anye amaayie akam ñnyịn.<verse eid="EZR 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24" />Akema, ami mmaasio awo duob mme iba ke atu mme adaaha aku nnịm, ammọ ekedoñño Serebia, Hasabaiya ye nditọeka ideen ammọ duob, <verse eid="EZR 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25" />ndin ami mmaadomo ndeeme nnọ ammọ mme enọ ake silfa, kold ye mme ñkpọ se adidem, ye mme anọitem amọ, mme ñkpoon mbon utom amọ, ye afịd nditọ Isrel se ikiba do ekenọọ, kpa enọ ake ufọk Abasi ñnyịn. <verse eid="EZR 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26" />Ami mmaadomo nnọ ammọ talen silfa ikie itiokeed ye aba mme duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 24 me ñkpọ nte metrịk tọọn 22</char></note>, ye mme ñkpọ ake silfa adoppoke ñkpọ nte talen (100) ikie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 3 3/4 me ñkpọ nte metrịk tọọn 3.4</char></note>, ye talen kold ikie, <verse eid="EZR 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27" />usan kold edịb a-anieghe ekọmudua darik tọsịn keed (1,000)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 8.4</char></note>, ye mfọọn nsem-nsem ñkpọ brọns, a-asọññọ udua nte kold.<verse eid="EZR 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28" />Ami mmaadọkkọ ammọ nte, “Ndufo ye mme afịd ñkpọ ami edoñño adisana enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Mme silfa ye kold ami edoñño enọ imaesịd enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ñnyịn. <verse eid="EZR 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29" />Ndufo itịm ikpeme ammọ tutu edomo ammọ ke esịd akwere ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke Yeruselem ke iso mme adaaha aku ye Lifai ye mme adaaha ke mme ubon Isrel.” <verse eid="EZR 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30" />Ndin mme aku ye mme Lifai emaebọ mme silfa ye kold ye mme ndisana ñkpọ emaekedomo nọ ekoono ekaa ufọk Abasi ñnyịn ke Yeruselem.<verse eid="EZR 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31" />Ke ayọhọ usen duob mme iba ke akpa afiọñ, ñnyịn imaidakka ito ke Inuaakpa Ahafa adika Yeruselem. Ubọk Abasi ñnyịn amaaba ye ñnyịn, ndin anye amaikpeme ñnyịn asio ke ubọk mme asua ye mbon mfịna ke usʌñ isañ. <verse eid="EZR 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32" />Ndin ñnyịn imaikiwuọ Yeruselem, imainyʌñ iduọk adudu ke usen ita.<verse eid="EZR 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33" />Ke ayọhọ usen inaañ, ke ufọk Abasi ñnyịn, ñnyịn imaidoomo mme silfa, mme kold ye mme ndisana ñkpọ idọñ ke ubọk Meremọd, ayịn aku Yuria. Eliasa ayịn Finehas akeba ye anye, ñko ye mme Lifai Yoosabad, ayịn Yesua ye Nahalal ayịn Binui. <verse eid="EZR 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34" />Emaewet afịd ñkpọ esịn ke ñwed ekeene ibad ye udob, emaewet afịd ami esịn ke ñwed kpa ke idaha ado.<verse eid="EZR 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35" />Ndin mbon se ikito idi ke itie ammọ ekebaaha ke ñkọbntem emaewa mme ufọfọb uwa ami enọ Abasi Isrel: ñyaaraenañ duob mme iba enọ afịd ikọd Isrel, akukịmedọñ anaañ mme duob mme itiokeed, ñyịn akukịmedọñ ata mme duob mme itiaba, ñko nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ, emaewa akpoebod duob mme iba. Afịd ami akedo ufọfọb uwa anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EZR 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ edat mme ewʌhọ adidem enọ mbon se ise utom inọ adidem ye mme adaukara ke Edem Inyañ Yufretis, ndin ammọ emaenwam nditọ Isrel ke utom adibọp ufọk nnọọ Abasi.<verse eid="EZR 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9" />
  <para style="s1">Akam Esra ke abaña Adidọ Ndọ ye Mbon Idịd Mfen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1" />Ke emaekenam afịd mme ñkpọ ami ema, mme adadusʌñ emaedi embịne miin, enyʌñ ebo, “Mbon Isrel, mme aku, ye mme Lifai, idiaññake idem ammọ ikpọñ mbọhọidʌñ ammọ, e-enieghe mme mbubiam ido, ukem nte ake mbon Kenan, Hed, Peris, Yebus, Amọn, Mọb, Iyib ye Amọọ. <verse eid="EZR 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2" />Ammọ ekoono usʌk nditọ ibaan ke atu ibon ami enọ idem ammọ ye nditọ ideen ammọ nte ibaan ndọ, enyʌñ ewuak adisana ubon ye mme idịd mfen ke mbọhọidʌñ ammọ. Ndin mme adadusʌñ ye ñkpoonawo utom edat usʌñ ke mme idiọọk ido ami.”<verse eid="EZR 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3" />Ami ñkekop ikọ ami, ami mmaawai mme nsiine mmi, ndʌt ided ke iwuod ye ñwa ebek mmi ñnyʌñ nsuuk ntie ke isọñ ke ñkpaidem. <verse eid="EZR 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4" />Akema afịd awo se ibaak ikọ Abasi Isrel emaeditie eñkanna miin ekʌk ke ntak idiọọk ido mbon se eketañ esịññe ke abio. Ami mmaanyʌñ ntie do ke ñkpaidem tutu ini uwa ndubiayio adikem.<verse eid="EZR 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5" />Akema ke ini uwa ndubiayio, ami mmaadakka nda ke itie mfʌhọ mmi, mme nsiine idem mmi emaewaiya, ñnyʌñ nduọ ke edọñ mmi, ntat ubọk nnọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi, <verse eid="EZR 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6" />ñnyʌñ mbọñ akam mbo nte:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 9:6">“Abasi mmi, abuud ye asuenne emmʌm ebọhọ, ami adidịppe iso mmi use fiin, sia mme idiọọkñkpọ ñnyịn e-ekoñ ekan etịñiwuod ñnyịn, ndudue ñnyịn e-enyʌñ ekesịm mme hefịn. <verse eid="EZR 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7" />Tọọñọ ke ini mme eteete ñnyịn tutu idahami, mme ndudue ñnyịn asʌk akpokpon ke ntak mme idiọọkñkpọ ñnyịn, ñnyịn ye ndidem ñnyịn, ye mme aku ñnyịn imikịt afai ye ñkọbntem, mbịme ye asuenne ke ubọk mme isen ndidem, kpa nte asʌkkọ ado mfịn mmi.<verse eid="EZR 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8" />“Ado idahami, ke etək ini, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn atua ñnyịn mbọm, afọn ido ke adinọ ñnyịn ñyọhọnsʌhọ anyʌñ inọ ñnyịn nsọọñọnda itie ke adisana itie amọ, ñko Abasi ñnyịn anam yak ikịt unwana ye etək mfuud ke nnananyen ñnyịn. <verse eid="EZR 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9" />Akpesʌkado ñnyịn idooho mme ifʌn, Abasi ñnyịn ifreke ñnyịn ke nnananyen ñnyịn. Anye iwọt ñnyịn mfọn ke iso mme ndidem Pesia: Anye inọ ñnyịn ufa uwem adimaana mbọp ufọk ake Abasi ñnyịn ñnyʌñ ndiọñ ñwuudo, anye ñko inọ ñnyịn ndibene ukpeme ke Yuda ye ke Yeruselem.<verse eid="EZR 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10" />“Ado idahami, Abasi ñnyịn, nsoo ke ñnyịn ikeme aditañ ke ñkpọ anye mi amaakweeñe? Sia ñnyịn imaisịn mme ewʌhọ <verse eid="EZR 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11" />a-afo akenọọhọ ato ke mme isʌñutom mfo, mme prọfed ke ini a-afo akebooho ate: ‘Isọñ ake ndufo edʌkkọ ekaa adidat idooho adisana akeene ndiọi ñkpọ mme andidʌñ ke isọñ ado. Ato mme mbubiam ido ammọ, isọñ ado ayọhọ ye ndek tọọñọ ke itie keed tutu akesịm akpatre. <verse eid="EZR 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12" />Ke ntoro, ikiiyaak nditọ ibaan ndufo inọọ nditọ ideen ammọ ke ndọ, ikiinyʌñ iyaak nditọ ideen ndufo edat nditọ ibaan ammọ ke ndọ. Ndufo ikiinyʌñ iyem edioomo ufan ye ammọ tutu amama, nọ ato do ndufo ediikop uko enyʌñ edia mme mfọn isọñ ado, enyʌñ ekpọñ enọ nditọ ndufo nte udeeme inie ke nsi-nsi.’<verse eid="EZR 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13" />“Se itịppe inọ ñnyịn ado utịb idiọọk ido ñnyịn ye ekamba ndudue ñnyịn, ado afo Abasi ñnyịn, afo umiaha ñnyịn ufen yak akekem naña idiọọkñkpọ ñnyịn ado, amenyʌñ inọ ñnyịn ñyọhọnsʌhọ ami. <verse eid="EZR 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14" />Nte ana ñnyịn imaana ibiat mme mbed mfo inyʌñ idudọiyọ ye mbon e-enamma utọ mbubiam ido ami? Nte afo uduuyatta esịd ye ñnyịn tutu afo isobo ñnyịn, unyʌññọ usio nsʌhọ ndomokeed unịm? <verse eid="EZR 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, afo amenen! Mfịn ami, ñnyịn se iba ido ataa etək nsʌhọ. Se ñnyịn mi ke iso mfo ye ndudue ñnyịn, akpesʌkado a-adooho ke ntak idiọọkñkpọ ñnyịn ami, ibaaha awo keed ke atu ñnyịn a-adotto adida ke iso mfo.”<verse eid="EZR 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10" />
  <para style="s1">Uyaara Idiọọkñkpọ Mbon Awo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1" />Ke idaha Esra akesʌkkọ abọñ akam, akpe ubọk ayaara idiọọkñkpọ, atua anyʌñ atọọñ idem ke isọñ ke iso ufọk Abasi, ekandịk atu nditọ Isrel, ideen, ibaan ye ntəkayịn emaedisoobo ekanna anye ekʌk. Ammọ ñko emaetua idod-idod ayịd eti-eti. <verse eid="EZR 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2" />Ndin Sekanaiya ayịn Yehiel, keed ke atu nditọ Elam, amaabo Esra ate, “Ñnyịn imidue inyʌññọ inam akpanikọ ye Abasi ñnyịn ke adidọ mme isen ibaan ito mme ñkanñkʌk abio ami. Ado, akpesʌkado abaaha ntom, idodanyen aba anọ Isrel. <verse eid="EZR 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3" />Yak ñnyịn inam edioomo ke iso Abasi ñnyịn adibịne afịd ibaan ami ye nditọ ammọ nsio, nte asañake ke item abọọñ mmi ye mbon se inịm mme mbed Abasi ñnyịn. Yak enam ami ekeene Mbed. <verse eid="EZR 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4" />Dakka da; sia ñkpọ ami asịne ke ubọk mfo. Ñnyịn iyaida ye afo, ndin kop uko nyʌñ nam ami.”<verse eid="EZR 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5" />Do ndin, Esra amaadakka ada anyʌñ anam mme aku se ido mme adaiwuod ye mbon Lifai ye afịd mbon Isrel enwọñọ ke iyainam se eketañ ami. Ñko ammọ emaedat unwọñọ ado. <verse eid="EZR 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6" />Akema Esra amaawuọ akpọñ ufọk Abasi anyʌñ akaa ubeed Yehohanan, ayịn Eliasịb. Idaha a-anye akebaaha do, anye ikidiaha ndidia inyʌññọ inwọñ mmọọñ, ado amaakaa iso afʌhọ abaña ukwaññkpọ mbon e-ekebịneke esio ke abio.<verse eid="EZR 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7" />Emaenọ uyio ke afịd Yuda ye Yeruselem ebo yak afịd mbon se ekebịne esio ke abio edisoobo ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="EZR 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:8" />Akena edia awo akeedodo atreke adiwuọ ndi ke ufañ usen ita isob ke adibọi anye afịd inie se anye anie, enyʌñ ebịne awo ado esio kpa ke atu mme esob mbon se ekebịne esịññe ke abio, akeene ubiere mme adaaha ye mme ñkpisọñ Isrel.<verse eid="EZR 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9" />Ke ufañ usen ita, afịd mme ideen Yuda ye Benyamin emaediboho ke itie keed ke Yeruselem. Ndin ke ayọhọ usen edịb ke afiọñ usʌkkeed, afịd awo emaebono do ke anwa ke iso ufọk Abasi, eba ke ayeemensia ke ntak ñkpọ ami ye ke ntak edịm. <verse eid="EZR 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10" />Akema aku Esra amaadakka ada anyʌñ adọkkọ ammọ ate, “Ndufo emenam idiọọk ido; ndufo emedọi isen ibaan, enam ndudue Isrel atọt. <verse eid="EZR 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11" />Idahami ndufo ikpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ndufo, inyʌñ inam uduak amọ. Idiañña idem ndufo ikpọñ mbon e-edʌññọ ikanna ndufo ye mme isen ibaan ndọ ndufo.”<verse eid="EZR 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12" />Afịd atu esob emaebọọrọ ke akpọsọñ uyio, ete: “Afo amenen! Ana ñnyịn inam naña afo atañ. <verse eid="EZR 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13" />Ado mbon awo mi enekke ewak, ñko ukwọedịm ado ami; ke ntoro ñnyịn idiikanna ida ke esiin. Ke abeeghe ado, ñkpọ ami idooho ñkpọ usen keed me iba, sia ñnyịn iminekke idue ke ñkpọ ami. <verse eid="EZR 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14" />Yak mme adaaha ñnyịn eda ke iwuod afịd esob. Ndin yak afịd awo ke mme abio ñnyịn e-edọọhọ awonwaan asenidịd ewuọ edi ke ini e-enịmme, esaña ye mme ñkpisọñ ye mme abiideikpe ke mme abio keedekeed, tutu ufiob iyadesịd Abasi ñnyịn ke ñkpọ ami awọññọ ikpọñ ñnyịn.” <verse eid="EZR 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15" />Yọnatan ayịn Asahel ye Yaseiya ayịn Tikfa, ye Mesulam ye Sabetai awo Lifai, ekedo ukweeñe mbon se ikifaaña ikọ ami ye ammọ ñko.<verse eid="EZR 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16" />Ndin mbon ekebịneke esịññe ke abio emaenam ukem se ekebiere ami. Aku Esra amaasio mme awo e-ekedoññoke mme adaiwuod ke mme ubon, keed kwa ikpeghe ufọk, afịd ammọ ke anyịñ ke anyịñ. Ammọ emaebono akpa usen ke afiọñ duob eduuñọ mme ñkpọ ami, <verse eid="EZR 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17" />ndin ke akpa usen ke akpa afiọñ ammọ emaema adise ñkpọ mbaña afịd mme ideen se ikidọi mme isen ibaan.<verse eid="EZR 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbon se Ikidue ke Adidọ Isen Ibaan</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18" />Ke ufọọd mme nditọ mme aku, mbon ami ekedọi ibaan asenidịd:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:18">Ke atu mbon Yọsua ayịn Yosadak, ye mme nditọeka ideen amọ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:18">Maaseiya, Eliesa, Yarịb ye Kedalia. <verse eid="EZR 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19" />(Afịd ammọ emaesọọñọ ubọk ammọ ke ubiọñ ebo ke mmimọ iyaibiiñe isen ibaan ndọ mmimọ, ndin ke ndudue ammọ, ammọ keedekeed emaenọ akukịmedọñ ato ke ufene nte uwa ndudue.)<verse eid="EZR 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20" />Ke atu ubon Imma:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:20">Hanani ye Sebadaiya.<verse eid="EZR 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21" />Ke atu ubon Harim:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:21">Maaseiya, Elaiya, Semaiya, Yehiel ye Usaiya.<verse eid="EZR 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22" />Ke atu ubon Pasọ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:22">Elioenai, Maaseiya, Ismeel, Netanel, Yoosabad ye Eleasa.<verse eid="EZR 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23" />Ke atu mme Lifai:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:23">Yoosabad, Simei, Kelaiya (a-adooho Kelita), Petahia, Yuda ye Eliesa.<verse eid="EZR 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24" />Ke atu mbon ikwọ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:24">Eliasịb.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:24">Ke atu mme akpeme inuaatob:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:24">Salum, Telem ye Uri.<verse eid="EZR 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25" />Ke atu nditọ Isrel mbon ako:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:25">Ke atu mme ubon Paros:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:25">Ramia, Isia, Malkiya, Miyamịn, Eliasa, Makiya ye Benaiya.<verse eid="EZR 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26" />Ke atu mme ubon Elam:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:26">Matania, Sakaraiya, Yehiel, Abdi, Yeremọd ye Elaiya.<verse eid="EZR 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27" />Ke atu mme ubon Satu:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:27">Elioenai, Eliasịb, Matania, Yeremọd, Sabad ye Asisa.<verse eid="EZR 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28" />Ke atu mme ubon Bebai:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:28">Yehohanan, Hananaiya, Sebai ye Atalai.<verse eid="EZR 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29" />Ke atu mme ubon Bani:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:29">Mesulam, Maluk, Adaiya, Yasub, Siel ye Yeremọd.<verse eid="EZR 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30" />Ke atu mme ubon Pahad-Moab:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:30">Adna, Kelal, Benaiya, Maaseiya, Matania, Besalel, Binui ye Manase.<verse eid="EZR 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31" />Ke atu mme ubon Harim:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:31">Eliesa, Isiya, Malkiya, Semaiya, Simiọn, <verse eid="EZR 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:32" />Benyamin, Maluk ye Semaria.<verse eid="EZR 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33" />Ke atu mme ubon Hasum:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:33">Matenai, Matata, Sabad, Elifeled, Yeremai, Manase ye Simei.<verse eid="EZR 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34" />Ke atu mme ubon Bani:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:34">Maadai, Amram, Uwel, <verse eid="EZR 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 10:35" />Benaiya, Bedia, Keluhi, <verse eid="EZR 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 10:36" />Fania, Meremọd, Eliasịb, <verse eid="EZR 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:37" />Matania, Matenai ye Yaasu.<verse eid="EZR 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38" />Ke atu ubon Binui:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:38">Simei, <verse eid="EZR 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 10:39" />Selemia, Natan, Adaiya, <verse eid="EZR 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 10:40" />Maknadebai, Sasai, Sarai, <verse eid="EZR 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 10:41" />Asarel, Selemia, Semaria, <verse eid="EZR 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:42" />Salum, Amaria ye Yosef.<verse eid="EZR 10:42" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43" />Ke atu ubon Nebo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:43">Yeiyel, Matitia, Sabad, Sebina, Yadai, Yuel ye Benaiya.<verse eid="EZR 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44" />Afịd mbon ami emaedọi isen ibaan, ubaak ammọ ñko emaebon nditọ eto mme ibaan ndọ ami.<verse eid="EZR 10:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10" />
</usx>